6dcc8bd2-02d5-4360-a32a-6d00f32d07a5	claude-sonnet-5	pass	0.9	The feedback accurately describes the initialization and traversal as correct, correctly identifies the bug (multiplying by 2) in the return statement, and explains why the return item was not earned - matching the required point about the returned value. It does not provide the full corrected code (just a brief instruction "Return the accumulated total itself" which is a hint, not a full solution). It is actionable since the student knows exactly what to fix. It is consistent with the awarded points (r1, r2 awarded, r3 not awarded, matching the feedback's description).	{"accurate": true, "actionable": true, "no_full_solution": true, "consistent_with_award": true, "covers_required_points": true}	78c0adbd54b357ec3f8612d6e6037b830a984282b756a1c65eca5373d9e22ec6	a56455b1-aeb4-473e-af99-6bc8c6cafdcc	2026-11-11 01:50:54.176952+00
